Exact Research Commons RC1 solver

parity-solver solve [REQUEST|-] [--output NEW_FILE]
parity-solver check REQUEST CERTIFICATE
parity-solver --help

Without REQUEST, solve reads stdin. All requests use canonical ASCII RC1.
SAT/UNSAT and LAW TABLE exit 0; UNKNOWN and conditional count exit 2; invalid input exits 1.
Check independently verifies request-bound witness/exclusion certificates.
LAW checking replays the bounded full joint genealogy compiler.
No scientific source admission or complete unrestricted registry is inferred.
